      "id": "claim_4eae0f38b8aa4c2e93813478e47976d4",
      "statement": "Brijio is a pnpm TypeScript workspace connecting remote AI agents to the user's own browser session via the explicit chain MCP server -> WebSocket relay -> browser extension, with the shared protocol and browser-agnostic logic in packages/shared; it is intentionally reactive and privacy-first with no continuous streaming, mirroring, cookie export, or background surveillance.",
