      "id": "claim_e51719ecc6f94554a0127bd38ce50b25",
      "statement": "The monorepo's major domains are servers/mcp (agent-facing tools/resources/prompts/skills), servers/websocket (state-light relay for pairing-token auth, presence, and routing), clients/extensions/chrome and clients/extensions/safari (thin browser adapters around the shared controller), and packages/shared (the single shared protocol and browser-agnostic logic all layers import).",
