    },
    {
      "id": "claim_edf1ba11d65d437db07a12093baab2cb",
      "statement": "The MCP server registers exactly 17 tools spanning reads, actions, navigation, tabs, batch, downloads, fetch, and screenshot: list_browsers, list_tabs, read_current_page, click_element, fill_input, fill_editable, set_checked, select_options, upload_file, submit_form, navigate_to_url, open_tab, perform_batch, download_status, download_file, fetch_resource, capture_screenshot; each tab-operating tool accepts optional browserInstanceId and tabId for per-call targeting except open_tab which creates a tab and has no tabId input.",
